@MyStash.CoreApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5054

GET {{MyStash.CoreApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Get transactions with OData filtering
GET {{MyStash.CoreApi_HostAddress}}/odata/Transactions?api-version=1.0&$filter=Amount gt 100&$orderby=Date desc&$top=25&$count=true
Accept: application/json

### Get accounts with OData filtering
GET {{MyStash.CoreApi_HostAddress}}/odata/Accounts?api-version=1.0&$filter=IsActive eq true&$orderby=Name&$top=25&$count=true
Accept: application/json

### Get transaction OData metadata
GET {{MyStash.CoreApi_HostAddress}}/odata/Transactions/$metadata?api-version=1.0
Accept: application/xml

### Get account OData metadata
GET {{MyStash.CoreApi_HostAddress}}/odata/Accounts/$metadata?api-version=1.0
Accept: application/xml

###
